{"id":"c0539430d79c5d3857c4c7c55fbb41282dc70e60","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"c0539430d79c5d3857c4c7c55fbb41282dc70e60","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/help-all-flag.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+`pnpm help --all` and `pnpm help -a` now print the full list of commands. They used to fail with an \"unrecognized subcommand\" error."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/help_all.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,38 @@","+//! `pnpm help --all` (`-a`).","+//!","+//! pnpm's `help` lists only its common commands unless `--all` is given","+//! (`pnpm11/pnpm/src/cmd/help.ts`). Clap's help subcommand already lists","+//! every command and declares no options, so the flag is dropped before","+//! clap parses argv.","+","+use crate::flag_relocation::{ArgTable, find_positional};","+use clap::Command;","+use std::ffi::{OsStr, OsString};","+","+/// Remove `--all`, `-a`, and the other spellings of the boolean (`--all=<value>`,","+/// `--no-all`) from the arguments of the `help` subcommand. Their value is","+/// ignored, since clap's help is always the full list. A no-op for every other","+/// command line.","+pub(crate) fn drop_all_flag(cmd: &Command, argv: Vec<OsString>) -> Vec<OsString> {","+    let top_level = ArgTable::top_level(cmd);","+    let subcommand_union = ArgTable::subcommand_union(cmd);","+    let Some(subcommand_index) = find_positional(&argv, 1, &top_level, &subcommand_union) else {","+        return argv;","+    };","+    if argv[subcommand_index] != \"help\" {","+        return argv;","+    }","+    argv.into_iter()","+        .enumerate()","+        .filter(|(index, token)| *index <= subcommand_index || !spells_all_flag(token))","+        .map(|(_, token)| token)","+        .collect()","+}","+","+fn spells_all_flag(token: &OsStr) -> bool {","+    token","+        .to_str()","+        .is_some_and(|token| {","+            matches!(token, \"--all\" | \"-a\" | \"--no-all\") || token.starts_with(\"--all=\")","+        })","+}"],"additions":38,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/lib.rs","lines":["@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@ mod executable_link;"," mod fatal_error;"," mod flag_relocation;"," mod github_actions;","+mod help_all;"," mod install_as_add;"," mod leading_separator;"," mod package_specifier;","@@ -432,6 +433,7 @@ fn prepare_cli_argv(argv: Vec<OsString>) -> (clap::Command, Vec<OsString>) {","     let argv = renamed_options::drop_shadowed_aliases(&command, argv);","     let argv = relocate_pre_subcommand_flags(&command, argv);","     let argv = install_as_add::rewrite(&command, argv);","+    let argv = help_all::drop_all_flag(&command, argv);","     let argv = leading_separator::preserve_leading_separator(argv);","     (command, argv)"," }"],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/tests.rs","lines":["@@ -54,3 +54,9 @@ fn rayon_pool_is_the_scaled_parallelism_between_4_and_16_threads() {","     assert_eq!(parallelism.map(|cores| rayon_pool_size(cores, 2)), [4, 4, 6, 8, 16, 16, 16, 16]);","     assert_eq!(parallelism.map(|cores| rayon_pool_size(cores, 1)), [4, 4, 4, 4, 8, 9, 16, 16]);"," }","+","+#[test]","+fn a_script_named_help_keeps_its_all_flags() {","+    let (_, prepared) = prepare_cli_argv(argv(&[\"pnpm\", \"run\", \"help\", \"-a\", \"--all\"]));","+    assert_eq!(prepared, argv(&[\"pnpm\", \"run\", \"help\", \"-a\", \"--all\"]));","+}"],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/help.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,38 @@","+use assert_cmd::prelude::*;","+use command_extra::CommandExtra;","+use pnpm_testing_utils::bin::CommandTempCwd;","+use pretty_assertions::assert_eq;","+use std::process::Command;","+","+fn help_stdout(args: &[&str]) -> String {","+    let CommandTempCwd { root, workspace, .. } = CommandTempCwd::init();","+    let output = Command::cargo_bin(\"pnpm\")","+        .expect(\"find the pnpm binary\")","+        .with_current_dir(&workspace)","+        .with_args(args)","+        .output()","+        .expect(\"run pnpm help\");","+    drop(root);","+    let stderr = String::from_utf8_lossy(&output.stderr);","+    assert!(output.status.success(), \"pnpm {args:?} failed: {stderr}\");","+    String::from_utf8(output.stdout).expect(\"help output is UTF-8\")","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn help_all_lists_every_command() {","+    let help = help_stdout(&[\"help\"]);","+    for command in [\"cat-index\", \"find-hash\", \"store\", \"cache\"] {","+        assert!(help.contains(&format!(\"\\n  {command} \")), \"{command} missing from: {help}\");","+    }","+    assert_eq!(help_stdout(&[\"help\", \"--all\"]), help);","+    assert_eq!(help_stdout(&[\"help\", \"-a\"]), help);","+    assert_eq!(help_stdout(&[\"help\", \"--all=true\"]), help);","+    assert_eq!(help_stdout(&[\"help\", \"--no-all\"]), help);","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn help_all_with_a_command_prints_that_command() {","+    let install_help = help_stdout(&[\"help\", \"install\"]);","+    assert_eq!(help_stdout(&[\"help\", \"-a\", \"install\"]), install_help);","+    assert_eq!(help_stdout(&[\"help\", \"install\", \"--all\"]), install_help);","+}"],"additions":38,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/main.rs","lines":["@@ -73,6 +73,7 @@ mod git_hosted_install;"," mod global;"," mod global_shims;"," mod global_virtual_store;","+mod help;"," mod hoist;"," mod hoisted_node_linker;"," mod hooks;",""],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":90,"deletions":0,"truncated":false,"file_count":6},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-23T14:14:43.695882+00:00"}